<title>TURKEY: Turkish central bank raises key lending rates.</title>
<headline>Turkish central bank raises key lending rates.</headline>
<dateline>ANKARA 1997-08-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Turkish central bank raised its discount rate to 67 percent from 50 percent and the rate used in advances to 80 percent from 57 percent after a rise in interest rates, the bank said in a statement on Saturday.</p>
</text>
